Comment: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,走啦走啦
Comment: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,完全離校時間快到了
Comment: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請各位學生盡快回家
Comment: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:52.78,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,完全離校時間快到了  請各位學生盡快回家
Comment: 0,0:10:50.73,0:10:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好快就黃昏了呢
Comment: 0,0:10:54.44,0:10:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,給妳 這是御坂的份
Comment: 0,0:10:57.23,0:10:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝...
Comment: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不行啦 還是交出去比較好
Comment: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說的也是啊
Comment: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等等和初春聯絡吧
Comment: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對了 佐天
Comment: 0,0:11:09.97,0:11:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳有聽說關於儲蓄卡散佈者方面的謠言嗎?
Comment: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這方面倒是沒聽說呢
Comment: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再見 御坂 下次也叫初春一起找吧
Comment: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好啊
Comment: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼再見啦
Comment: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再見
Comment: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果一天就這樣過去了
Comment: 0,0:11:33.24,0:11:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我在做什麼啊...
Comment: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是真的啦
Comment: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我在E區的小巷打算要小便的時候
Comment: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看到一個女人正在放置這個信封
Comment: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,於是我就跟蹤在她後面
Comment: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,然後那女的進了C區的某棟商業住宅大樓
Comment: 0,0:11:51.91,0:11:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那裡一定是她的老巢啊
Comment: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只有一個女人啊?
Comment: 0,0:11:54.97,0:11:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,應該有同伴吧?
Comment: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我仔細調查過 真的只有一個女人
Comment: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,去看看就知道了
Comment: 0,0:12:02.39,0:12:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你是怎麼調查的啊?
Comment: 0,0:12:04.28,0:12:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我一直在外面監視著
Comment: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你還真勤勞啊...
Comment: 0,0:12:07.40,0:12:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是久違的好事呢
Comment: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子嗎? 嗯 我跟妳說
Comment: 0,0:12:15.53,0:12:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有事情要拜託妳
Comment: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:18.04,Default,break,0,0,0,,CM
Comment: 0,0:12:18.04,0:12:20.76,Default,002,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,歡迎回來
Comment: 0,0:12:23.48,0:12:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,統計完了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是的 今天總計73件
Comment: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,每天都不斷地增加呢
Comment: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對了 白井呢?
Comment: 0,0:12:33.81,0:12:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好像有什麼急事 已經回去了喔
Comment: 0,0:12:37.19,0:12:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 我去吃飯喔
Comment: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:43.46,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,吃飯~吃飯~
Comment: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 是佐天啊
Comment: 0,0:12:48.90,0:12:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,佐天也撿到了儲蓄卡啊?
Comment: 0,0:12:52.23,0:12:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好 我知道了
Comment: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 明天給我就可以了
Comment: 0,0:12:56.01,0:12:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對了
Comment: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我知道了
Comment: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在妳回來以前陪著春上就好了吧?
Comment: 0,0:13:03.79,0:13:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,麻煩妳了
Comment: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊 等等 初春
Comment: 0,0:13:08.13,0:13:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有件事想要問妳
