Comment: 0,0:13:12.99,0:13:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對 中午和白井一起拿撿到的儲蓄卡過來
Comment: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊 果然是我看錯了啊...
Comment: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有啦 沒事
Comment: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,掰掰囉
Comment: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然是我看錯了啊...
Comment: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸? 和御坂長的一模一樣的人?
Comment: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對啊 佐天似乎有看到
Comment: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說到這個
Comment: 0,0:13:43.26,0:13:46.90,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(930,980)}Level 5
