Comment: 0,0:14:19.33,0:14:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 御坂人呢?
Comment: 0,0:14:21.17,0:14:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 黑子
Comment: 0,0:14:22.81,0:14:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,洗髮精用完了喔
