Comment: 0,0:14:25.88,0:14:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人真是的
Comment: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真抱歉 舍監大人
Comment: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等我一下喔
Comment: 0,0:14:34.01,0:14:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,快一點啦 黑子
Comment: 0,0:14:35.85,0:14:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好的好的
