Comment: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,嘿嘿嘿嘿...
Comment: 0,0:15:21.16,0:15:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳乖一點我們就不會對妳動粗
