Comment: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,Equal
Comment: 0,0:16:07.45,0:16:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,手邊就只有這兩張喔
Comment: 0,0:16:09.29,0:16:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不可能吧
Comment: 0,0:16:10.93,0:16:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說 妳在這種狀況下還挺冷靜的嘛
Comment: 0,0:16:16.15,0:16:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這傢伙 莫非是能力者?
