Comment: 0,0:16:29.90,0:16:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然這樣 我們就徹底的搜吧
Comment: 0,0:16:32.56,0:16:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 你給我看好這傢伙
Comment: 0,0:16:36.40,0:16:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你在怕什麼啊?
Comment: 0,0:16:38.85,0:16:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我才沒有害怕咧
Comment: 0,0:16:40.95,0:16:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 別鬧了 快點找
Comment: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那邊有嗎?
