Comment: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可惡  到底藏在哪啊?
Comment: 0,0:16:50.11,0:16:52.56,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,你們安靜點 快找啊
Comment: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,該死 不知為何
Comment: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這女人讓人很不舒服啊
Comment: 0,0:16:57.27,0:16:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個校徽
Comment: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好像在那裡看過...
Comment: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,長點上機學院?
