Comment: 0,0:17:07.55,0:17:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然這傢伙是能力者嗎?
Comment: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不 等等 冷靜一點
